---

<Layout
  title="Delta-Neutral Liquidity Provision on Uniswap v3 (Aave Hedge)"
  description="Mathematical hedging framework for earning high concentrated liquidity LP fees on Uniswap v3 while neutralizing directional delta exposure using Aave v3 debt."
  canonical="https://site-19-nine.vercel.app/delta-neutral-liquidity-provision-uniswap-v3/"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-emerald-400">GreekVisualizer</a> / <span>DeFi Yield</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
      Delta-Neutral Liquidity Provision on Uniswap v3 using Aave Hedge
    </h1>

    <div class="bg-emerald-950/20 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500 border-y border-r border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xl mb-10">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-mono mb-2">
        ⚡ Quick Answer: Delta-Neutral LP
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Delta-neutral LPing on Uniswap v3</strong> isolates swapping fee APR by borrowing the volatile asset (e.g. ETH) from a lending protocol (e.g. Aave v3) using stablecoin collateral (USDC) before providing liquidity. Because the borrowed asset matches the exact quantity of volatile inventory in the LP position, price movements generate an offsetting debt liability, converting directional risk into pure volatility yield.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Architecture & Cash Flow Diagram</h2>
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      1. Deposit \$10,000 USDC into Aave v3 as Collateral (Health Factor: 2.2)<br/>
      2. Borrow \$4,000 worth of ETH from Aave debt pool<br/>
      3. Pair \$4,000 ETH + \$4,000 USDC into concentrated Uniswap v3 tick range [0.95P, 1.05P]<br/>
      4. Net Delta = (+1.0 LP ETH inventory) - (1.0 Aave ETH Debt) = 0.00 Delta
    </div>

    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Model option Greeks and yield strategies with our calculators: <a href="/uniswap-v3-concentrated-liquidity-impermanent-loss-calculator/" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Impermanent Loss Calculator</a> and <a href="/options-gamma-scalping-theta-decay-hedging-strategies/" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Gamma Scalping & Theta Decay Guide</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
      <span>GreekVisualizer Quantitative Lab</span>
      <a href="/" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Greeks Visualizer →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
